sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Human operator
    participant Prompt as /naos-d-start and /naos-task-start
    participant Agent as Plan/implement/review agents
    participant CLI as NAOS evidence commands
    participant Trace as spec-pack/spec-cascade/module-headers/test-evidence/AC evidence
    participant Review as Human review

    User->>Prompt: Start session and task
    Prompt->>Agent: Provide bounded task context
    Prompt->>Agent: Surface parallel_lane_opportunity / parallel_lane_decision
    Agent->>CLI: Recommend relevant evidence checks
    CLI->>Trace: Check requirement, source, and test linkage
    alt Parallel lanes explicitly declared
        Agent->>CLI: Fill lane handoff input and run handoff report
        CLI->>Review: Route handoff HITL reasons through control-plane review
    else Suggested or deferred lanes
        Agent->>Review: Keep as planning/scope review; no handoff activation
    end
    alt AI/governance instruction surface changed
        CLI->>Review: Include ai-surface-budget report
    end
    alt Session produced reusable lesson
        CLI->>Review: Include learning-loop-review; candidate remains proposal-only
    end
    Trace->>Review: Surface uncovered requirements and untraced source
    CLI->>Review: Produce reports and dashboard inputs
    Review->>Agent: Approve next work, request fixes, or defer
